==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|uːpə(ɹ)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|informal|lang=en}} An [[error]].
# {{context|baseball|slang|1800s|lang=en}} A [[fly ball]] that is weakly [[hit]] just over the [[infielders]].
# {{context|informal|lang=en}} A film or videotaped [[outtake]] that has recorded an amusing mistake and/or accident during the course of regular filming.
# {{context|nautical|lang=en}} A kind of [[sail]], a [[spanker]].

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|error}} [[blunder]], [[boo-boo]], [[faux pas]], [[fluff]], [[gaffe]], [[lapse]], [[mistake]], [[slip]], [[stumble]], [[thinko]]
* {{sense|baseball}} [[banjo hit]], [[Texas leaguer]]
* (an edited-out video/audio fragment containing a funny error) [[gag reel]]
* See also [[Wikisaurus:error]]

